## Algorithm Selection Guide

### Regression

```
What type of relationship?
├─ Linear: Linear Regression, Ridge, Lasso
├─ Non-linear: PolynomialFeatures + Linear, Decision Trees, Random Forest
├─ Complex non-linear: Gradient Boosting, Neural Networks
└─ Feature interactions needed: PolynomialFeatures, gradient boosting
```

### Classification

```
What's the problem?
├─ Binary, linear: Logistic Regression, SVM
├─ Multi-class: Any classifier works
├─ Non-linear, complex: Random Forest, Gradient Boosting
├─ Need probabilities: Logistic Regression, SVM(probability=True)
└─ Interpretability critical: Decision Trees, Logistic Regression
```

### Clustering

```
What are your clusters?
├─ Spherical, same size: K-Means (fast, simple)
├─ Arbitrary shapes: DBSCAN, Hierarchical Clustering
├─ Soft assignments: Gaussian Mixture Models
└─ Unknown k: Use elbow method + silhouette score
```

