### Common Pitfalls and Solutions

| Problem | Cause | Solution |
|---------|-------|----------|
| Data leakage | Scaling before split | Always split first, apply scaler to train only |
| Overfitting | Too complex model | Use regularization, simplify, get more data |
| Poor performance | Not tuning hyperparameters | Use GridSearchCV, RandomizedSearchCV |
| Imbalanced results | Class imbalance ignored | Use stratified split, SMOTE, class weights |
| Misleading accuracy | Imbalanced dataset | Use F1, ROC-AUC, PR-AUC instead |
| Slow training | Too many features | Use feature selection, PCA, sampling |
| Irreproducible | Random state not set | Always set random_state parameter |
| Wrong metric | Metric doesn't match problem | Choose metric aligned with business goals |

